OL,3,AKit Harington joins HBO's Harry Potter
OL,4,Aseries as Gilderoy Lockhart
OL,5,
OL,6,FBest known for playing Jon Snow for
OL,7,Feight seasons in the award-winning
OL,8,Fseries Game of Thrones, Harington also
OL,9,Fappears in the BBC and HBO financial
OL,10,Fdrama Industry. The casting marks the
OL,11,FEnglish actor's third collaboration
OL,12,Fwith the American network and streamer.
OL,14,FHarry Potter and the Philosopher's
OL,15,FStone is due to premiere on Christmas
OL,16,Fthis year on HBO Max.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/19
