OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ACharity? Acting? The Cotswolds? What
OL,4,Awill Harry and Meghan's UK life look
OL,5,Alike?
OL,6,
OL,7,FOver the weekend, there was a deluge of
OL,8,Fstories about Meghan's return to acting
OL,9,Fwith speculation she would have a role
OL,10,Fin the next series of The Gentlemen on
OL,11,FNetflix, created by British director
OL,12,FGuy Ritchie.
OL,14,FTalks are still said to be in the early
OL,15,Fstages and we understand filming for
OL,16,Fthe third series of the show is
OL,17,Fimminent - but Netflix has made no
OL,18,Fcomment on who will star, leaving the
OL,19,Fway open for a former working member of
OL,20,Fthe royal family with an acting
OL,21,Fbackground to be cast.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
