OL,9,G0504 The WhatsApp Underground
OL,10,     FIn June 2026, images of race riots
OL,11,     Fin Belfast were flashed around the
OL,12,     Fworld. An underground grassroots
OL,13,     Fnetwork quickly mobilised on
OL,14,     FWhatsApp to rescue and shelter
OL,15,     Fthose at risk.
